*      FAP                      EXP(1F           KAHAN 05/05/64         EXP(1 01
       COUNT   50                                                       EXP(1 02
       ENTRY   EXP(1            I**J,    AC=I,     MQ=J                 EXP(1 03
EXP(1  ARS     18                                                       EXP(1 04
       STO     POWER            SAVE BASE                               EXP(1 05
       ZAC                                                              EXP(1 06
       LLS     17                                                       EXP(1 07
       TNZ     NON0                                                     EXP(1 08
