       STO     FACTOR                                                   EXP(1 13
       TQP     CLA1                                                     EXP(1 14
       CLA     POWER            J LT.0,  EXAMINE I                      EXP(1 15
       LAS     FIXONE           COMPARE ABS(I) WITH 1                   EXP(1 16
       CLM                      ABS(I) GT.1,   SET I=0                  EXP(1 17
       TRA     SIGN             ABS(I)=1, LEAVE I ALONE.                EXP(1 18
       WTDA    3                ABS(I)=0,  0**(VE) ERROR                EXP(1 19
       RCHA    IOC              WRITE MESSAGE ON OUTPUT TAPE,           EXP(1 20
