       LDQ     POWER                                                    EXP(1 30
       MPY     FACTOR                                                   EXP(1 31
       STQ     FACTOR                                                   EXP(1 32
CLA2   CLA     EXP                                                      EXP(1 33
       ARS     1                                                        EXP(1 34
       STO     EXP                                                      EXP(1 35
       TNZ     LOOP                                                     EXP(1 36
EXIT   LLS     53                                                       EXP(1 37
       TRA     1,4                                                      EXP(1 38
  SIGN XCA                                                              EXP(1 39
       CLA     EXP                                                      EXP(1 40
       LBT                                                              EXP(1 41
       LRS     0                IF J IS EVEN, I**J IS POSITIVE          EXP(1 42
       ZAC                                                              EXP(1 43
       TRA     EXIT                                                     EXP(1 44
FIXONE DEC     1                                                        EXP(1 45
EXP    PZE     0                                                        EXP(1 46
