*      FAP     INTOVR(I)          FIXED PT. OVERFLOW TEST               INTOVR01
       COUNT   10                                                       INTOVR02
       ENTRY   INTOVR             INTOVR(I)                             INTOVR03
INTOVR ZAC                                                              INTOVR04
       TNO     *+2                                                      INTOVR05
       CLA     ONE                INTOVR=I=1 IF OVERFLOWED,             INTOVR06
       STO*    1,4                        =0 OTHERWISE,                 INTOVR07
       TRA     2,4                AND RESET OVERFLOW INDICATOR.         INTOVR08
 ONE   DEC     1B17                                                     INTOVR09
       END                                                              INTOVR10
